{"ID":"20240513083420-5r3atg4","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240513083420-5r3atg4","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513083420-5r3atg4\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513104439-4o87sy9\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513104439-4o87sy9\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513104439-4o87sy9\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:251\u0026#125;","title":"036","type":"doc","updated":"20240515124303"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240513104439-4o87sy9","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 978px;","id":"20240513104439-4o87sy9","updated":"20240515124303"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"倪醫師病案紀錄    初診日期：20080313"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"014-15 C, M"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"女"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"37歲，中等"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 20080522"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"服前方後，"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1. 早晚餐胃口好，中午不餓，硬吃則右肋氣痛"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"→"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中午胃氣未回，病仍未癒，須假以時日。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2. 睡仍淺、不易入眠"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→心臟仍不好"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3. 仍怕冷"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4. 服前方後下半身開始熱("},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"生硫磺"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":")、較不惡風"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5. 小便量大(跟以前差不多)、無頻數"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6. 足底仍怕風"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7. 關節痛，怕濕，洗澡後就痛"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8. 口渴有"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9. 體力好轉"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"10. 風吹身體時，胸怕風、心較悶"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"11. 皮膚濕潤"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→表虛"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"仍沉細"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"裡寒仍有(少陰)"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方：\n麻黃附子細辛湯合桂枝芍藥知母湯加減"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生硫黃三錢(另包)  "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"麻黃三錢  炮附子八錢  細辛二錢  桂枝五錢  白芍八錢  白朮三錢  炙甘草三錢  防風五錢  知母五錢  黃耆一兩  生薑二片  大棗十枚 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"二十付  "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"九碗煮三碗  "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"早晚飯前各服一碗"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1. 此人冷水積在下半身，用生硫磺『炸』後，氣化冷水，下半身溫度才升高。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2. 生附子味鹹色黑、入血入臟，用於去裡寒強心陽。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3. 生硫磺色淡黃、入三焦水道。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"備註："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"病人將回國"}]}]}]}]}